  /// following Amazon Inspector severity levels, which correspond to CVSS
  /// score ranges: informational - CVSS score of 0. low - CVSS score of 0.1
  /// to 3.9. medium - CVSS score of 4.0 to 6.9. high - CVSS score of 7.0 to
  /// 8.9. critical - CVSS score of 9.0 to 10.0. For more information, see
  /// Software package vulnerability severity in the Amazon Inspector User
  /// Guide . A scanned AMI that has no findings meets this limit. AMIs that
  /// Amazon Inspector has not scanned are not allowed when you specify this
