/// The Amazon Inspector scan results for an AMI. This information is
/// present only for AMIs that Amazon Inspector has scanned. When you share
/// an AMI with other accounts, organizations, or organizational units
/// (OUs), or make it public, its scan results are available to the accounts
/// that can use the AMI. The fix-available dates are specific to the AMI.
/// Each date reflects when a fix became available for a finding on that
/// AMI, not when the vendor released the fix. As a result, a date can be
/// later than the vendor's release date, and AMIs with the same
/// vulnerability can have different dates.
